# Scope: checkout button click on basket page -> checkout-queue -> atomic save basket reservation to CMS -> CMS response to queue -> queue pop 1, pass response -> ui receive response, save basket reservation id to session.

## Definition of Done - happy path

✔ [ ] API endpoint `/api/checkout-queue` accepts valid BasketReservation requests and queues them for processing @done(26-04-21 17:24)
✔ [ ] Queue processes requests atomically (FIFO, one at a time) with trace logging for verification @done(26-04-21 17:24)
✔ [ ] Creates basketReservation document in Sanity with verified prices (stripePriceId stripped, verifiedPrice added) @done(26-04-21 17:24)
✔ [ ] Increments reservedStock atomically on each product by requested quantity @done(26-04-21 17:24)
✔ [ ] Returns BasketReservationResponse with reservationId and product snapshot (stock, reservedStock, realPrice) @done(26-04-21 17:24)
✔ [ ] Saves reservationId to session and navigates user to checkout address page @done(26-04-21 17:24)
[ ] Reservations expire after TTL (15 minutes) and reservedStock is released back to available stock, basket reservation is deleted after

